    <h1 data-split data-split-delay="120">Publications</h1>
    <p class="lede">Formal research output from ARIES studies, plus the literature
    this pilot is grounded in. ARIES has no output of its own yet (Phase 1
    hasn&rsquo;t launched), so this page opens with what the proposal is
    building on instead of inventing findings that don&rsquo;t exist.</p>
  </div>
