<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="placeholder-block u-mb-40" data-reveal="up">
      ARIES&rsquo;s own findings will appear here once Phase 1 (the pilot survey) has run
      and been analysed. Nothing is published yet. This section will hold real
      titles, authors, dates, and abstracts, not sample entries.
    </div>

    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">Grounding literature</p>
    <h2 class="section-title u-mb-28" data-reveal="up">What this pilot is built on</h2>
    <div class="pub-list" data-reveal-group="up">
{%- for pub in publications %}
      <div class="pub-entry">
        <p class="pub-date">{{ pub.year }}</p>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ pub.title | safe }}</h3>
          <p class="pub-meta">{{ pub.source | safe }}</p>
          <p class="pub-abstract">{{ pub.abstract | safe }}</p>
        </div>
        <span class="pub-tag">{{ pub.tag }}</span>
      </div>
{%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="block-divider">
      <p class="eyebrow">Also referenced by title</p>
      <p class="lede u-maxw-640">These appear in the proposal&rsquo;s reading list without full
      author or date detail, so they&rsquo;re listed here by title only rather than filled in with
      invented citation data:</p>
      <ul class="ref-list u-mt-16">
        <li>The Education System, Routledge Handbook of Contemporary Bangladesh</li>
        <li>Reforming the Education System in Bangladesh: Reckoning a Knowledge-based Society</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
